  "description": "REGRESSION LOCK on the .get-default-vs-null class in build_assets. cx-null-fields carries tags, group_name, and users as explicit nulls -- routine for a server no one is logged into -- which used to abort the page in None.get and ';'.join(None), and its last_seen is a non-numeric string that used to die in int(). cx-null-ip has ip present but null, which used to abort in None + []. The bare non-object row locks the row-shape guard. cx-multi-mac proves an endpoint with two adapters keeps its second MAC: the addresses ride on the first MAC and the extra MAC is carried on its own interface rather than dropped.\n\nnamespaced_ids is skipped because the foreign id is the bare Cortex agent_id, the defect the happy scenario records.",
